  "fullDescription": "Add a cozy and playful touch to your Christmas décor with this Gingerbread Christmas Ornament STL Collection. The set features three unique gingerbread-inspired hanging ornaments, including classic gingerbread characters, a Santa-hat design, and a candy-cane accessory style.\n\nEach model includes charming decorative details such as icing accents, buttons, bows, scarves, rosy cheeks, and hanging loops. Perfect for 3D printing, Christmas trees, garlands, wreaths, seasonal displays, handmade gifts, and festive home décor.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\n3 unique gingerbread ornament designs\nSTL file format\nDesigned for 3D printing\nHanging ornament style\nDetailed icing and button accents\nSanta hat, scarf, bow, and candy-cane details\nPerfect for Christmas tree decoration\nGreat for wreaths and garlands\nSuitable for FDM and resin 3D printing\nIdeal for seasonal craft projects and gifts\nDigital product — no physical item included\n\nNote: This is a digital STL file, not a physical product. A compatible 3D printer is required to create the physical ornaments.",
